t-text-muted hover:text-text\">Projects</a><a href=\"#skills\" class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-text-muted hover:text-text\">Skills</a><a class=\"text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-text\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-3 md:flex-col md:flex-nowrap md:gap-2\"><a href=\"mailto:sahiljeetsinghkalsi@gmail.com\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"m4 7 8 6 8-6\"></path></svg>Email</a><a href=\"https://github.com/ghostofweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.58 2 12.2c0 4.5 2.87 8.32 6.84 9.67.5.1.68-.22.68-.49 0-.24-.01-1.04-.01-1.88-2.78.62-3.37-1.22-3.37-1.22-.45-1.18-1.11-1.5-1.11-1.5-.9-.64.07-.62.07-.62 1 .07 1.53 1.05 1.53 1.05.89 1.57 2.33 1.12 2.9.85.09-.66.35-1.12.63-1.37-2.22-.26-4.56-1.14-4.56-5.07 0-1.12.39-2.03 1.03-2.75-.1-.26-.45-1.31.1-2.72 0 0 .84-.28 2.75 1.05a9.3 9.3 0 0 1 5 0c1.91-1.33 2.75-1.05 2.75-1.05.55 1.41.2 2.46.1 2.72.64.72 1.03 1.63 1.03 2.75 0 3.94-2.34 4.8-4.57 5.06.36.32.68.94.68 1.9 0 1.37-.01 2.47-.01 2.81 0 .27.18.6.69.49A10.02 10.02 0 0 0 22 12.2C22 6.58 17.52 2 12 2Z\"></path></svg>GitHub</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sahiljeet-singh-kalsi-085844244/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.94 8.5H3.56V20.5H6.94V8.5Z\"></path><path d=\"M5.25 7.02a1.96 1.96 0 1 0 0-3.92 1.96 1.96 0 0 0 0 3.92Z\"></path><path d=\"M20.5 13.6c0-3.13-1.67-4.59-3.9-4.59-1.8 0-2.6.99-3.05 1.68V8.5H10.17c.05 1 0 12 0 12h3.38v-6.7c0-.36.03-.72.13-.98.29-.72.94-1.47 2.05-1.47 1.45 0 2.03 1.1 2.03 2.72V20.5h3.38l.36-6.9Z\"></path></svg>LinkedIn</a><a href=\"/resume.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 2.5h8l4 4v14.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-17.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2.5V7h4.5\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 12.5h7\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 15.75h7\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 19h4.5\"></path></svg>Resume</a><a href=\"https://cal.com/syntaxpath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"4.5\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M3.5 9.5h17\"></path><path d=\"M8 2.5v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2.5v4\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 13.5h2v2h-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></path></svg>Book a call</a></div></aside><main class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><header id=\"intro\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-10 flex-col items-start gap-5 pt-6 md:pt-10\"><div><p class=\"text-sm text-text-muted\">Hello, I&#x27;m</p><h1 class=\"mt-1 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-text sm:text-5xl\">Sahiljeet Singh Kalsi</h1><p class=\"mt-2 text-base font-medium text-accent\">Full-Stack Engineer<!-- --> <span class=\"text-text-muted\">· <!-- -->1.5+ years</span></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-accent-soft px-3 py-2\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-text\">Scale &amp; Cost</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">40% lower cloud cost, 32→4 core footprint</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-accent-soft px-3 py-2\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-text\">0→1 Builder</p><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Ships full-stack + AI products end-to-end</p></div></div><div class=\"max-w-xl\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-text\">I take products from 0 to 1, then make them cheap to run at scale.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Full-stack engineer working across Node.js, NestJS, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Redis, and AWS. I&#x27;ve cut cloud infrastructure costs by 40% through query and network optimization, and shipped multiple products end-to-end, from backend to deployment, often leaning on AI tooling to move faster.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-text sm:text-3xl\">0<!-- -->%</span><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted\">cut in cloud infra cost</p></div><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-text sm:text-3xl\">0</span><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted\">microservices migrated to AWS</p></div><div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-text sm:text-3xl\">0<!-- -->k+</span><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted\">concurrent users served</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-muted\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span><span><span class=\"text-text\">My Work:</span> <!-- -->Senior Full-Stack Developer at Newral - Build scalable backend systems, infrastructure, and distributed services for production applications serving 100,000+ concurrent users.</span></div><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Open to software engineering opportunities involving distributed systems, infrastructure, and scalable application development.</p></header><section id=\"experience\" class=\"mt-16 scroll-mt-10\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-text\">Experience</h2><div class=\"relative mt-6 pl-6\"><div class=\"absolute left-[3px] top-1 h-[calc(100%-8px)] w-px bg-border\"></div><div style=\"transform-origin:top\" class=\"absolute left-[3px] top-1 h-[calc(100%-8px)] w-px origin-top bg-accent\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-14\"><article class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-6 top-5 h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-accent\"></span><header class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain p-1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/assets/newral.svg\"/></span><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-0.5\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-base font-semibold text-text\">Newral</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Noida, Uttar Pradesh · On-site</p></div><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Sep 2025 - Present</p></div></header><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-7 sm:pl-[60px]\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4\"><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-text\">Software Engineer</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Jan 2026 - Present</p></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Own full-stack delivery on Competishun and Synapse, from query performance and infrastructure cost to the features users see.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent\">Competishun</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">EdTech platform for JEE/NEET aspirants with 100,000+ active users, served concurrently across a ~9-microservice architecture.</p><ul class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Reduced backend CPU usage from ~99% to ~25% through SQL query optimization, Redis caching, and workload restructuring.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Rebuilt the FFmpeg-based video transcoding pipeline, cutting processing time from 6 hours to under 30 minutes.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Cut cloud infrastructure cost by 40% by optimizing SQL queries and consolidating cross-service network calls onto a single network path, shrinking compute footprint from 32 cores to 4.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Led the migration of 9 microservices from GCP to AWS, improving scalability, reliability, and cost efficiency.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Resolved critical production issues across multiple microservices, leading to a ~90% reduction in app crashes.</li></ul></div><div><a href=\"https://synappses.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-serif text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent transition-colors hover:underline\">Synapse<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path><path d=\"M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Multi-tenant platform for creators and EdTech businesses to sell courses and products and engage their audience. Currently onboarding pilot clients.</p><ul class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Building the platform with NestJS, TypeScript, Prisma, and React.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Own architecture decisions for a multi-tenant system serving multiple EdTech businesses from a single codebase.</li></ul></div><div><p class=\"font-serif text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent\">Client projects</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted\">Backends for two separate US-based clients.</p><ul class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Designed and built the entire backend solo for Upto, a social media application, with NestJS, TypeScript, Prisma, and PostgreSQL.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Modeled the core social data layer (feed, relationships, content) for scale from day one.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Developed a scalable real-time backend with Node.js, Express, Redis, and WebSockets for a separate US-based startup.</li></ul></div><div><p class=\"font-serif text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent\">Across all projects</p><ul class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Set up CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions and unit and integration test suites.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Used AI-assisted development tools (GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, Antigravity, Cursor, and custom AI agents) to speed up delivery while maintaining code quality.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-border pt-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4\"><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-text\">Junior Software Developer Intern</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Sep 2025 - Dec 2025</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-6\"><div><ul class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Built and maintained microservices using NestJS, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Redis, and BullMQ.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Handled large-scale data operations across multiple SQL and NoSQL databases.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text\"><span class=\"mt-[9px] h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-text-muted\"></span>Resolved production issues across distributed microservices by analyzing application logs, improving system stability and reliability.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></article><article class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-6 top-5 h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-accent\"></span><header class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-white shadow-sm\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain p-1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%